  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership development in Relation to IMCC Nepal and PSRN-sc&#x2019;s Partnership Project on SRH(R) and Mental Health for adolescents in Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Partnership Development project will contribute to strengthening the foundation of the partnership between PSRN-sc and IMCC Nepal. It will take place in Nepal. We wish to create a broader inclusion in the partnership, aiming to make it more sustainable and democratic. We also aim to make our partnership and our work within this more transparent - also to the rest of PSRN-sc and for our future work together as partners. Our objective is to include members from at least four faculties in MEC.</narrative>
  </description>
